From fad25226ad9e572d4508d1e43c5b5b1735266f74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:39:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/57] drm/gma500: parse SGX firmware format v2 with transfer
 templates

sgx545_ukernel.fw v2 also carries the transfer-queue programs of a solid fill,
cut from the user's own libsrv_um.so: seven USE and PDS templates with their
placement records, a patch table for the colour, the PBE state and the task
kick words, and the fixed transfer command words. Teach the parser to read and
check them and to build the patched programs for a fill. v1 files still load.
KUnit covers the new paths.

Assisted-by: LLM
